### Get popular tags
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/popular-tags

### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?page=1&limit=10

### Get posts by category
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?categoryId=some-category-id&page=1&limit=10

### Create a new post
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Post",
  "content": "This is the content of my first post about pregnancy journey.",
  "categoryId": "pregnancy",
  "tags": ["pregnancy", "first-trimester", "support"],
  "isAnonymous": false,
  "media": [
    {
      "url": "https://example.com/image1.jpg",
      "type": "IMAGE",
      "caption": "First ultrasound"
    }
  ]
}

### Get a specific post
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/{{postId}}

### Update a post
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Post Title",
  "content": "Updated content about my pregnancy journey.",
  "tags": ["pregnancy", "second-trimester", "nutrition"]
}

### Like a post
POST http://localhost:3000/posts/{{postId}}/like

### Delete a post
DELETE http://localhost:3000/posts/{{postId}}
